---
// /admin/hr/separations — MOVED. One separation console, not two.
//
// This screen and /admin/hr/separation read and write the SAME hr_separations table. Two consoles
// over one table is how two people end up disagreeing about whether somebody has left: one of them
// shows the clearance checklist and the approval, the other does not, and whichever a person happens
// to open decides what they believe.
//
// Everything this page did — opening a separation, notice and last working day, knowledge transfer,
// the exit interview, relieving and experience letters, alumni invitation, rehire eligibility — is on
// the new console, alongside the parts it could not do: the routed approval, clearance across IT,
// Finance, HR and Assets, the settlement handoff, the reassignment of the leaver's direct reports,
// and the closing (never the deletion) of their edges on the Organization Graph.
//
// The redirect stays because the sidebar, /admin/hr and src/lib/admin-nav.ts all link to this path,
// and a link that 404s is worse than one that arrives.
return Astro.redirect('/admin/hr/separation', 302);
---
